-- WoW Forever: the Barkskin Burrow quest chain in Mount Hyjal. Live has 19 Barkskin quests; we had 3 (91696, 93827, 94504).
-- Needs 2026_11_22_91 (fdbquests kit 3: Elder Mistpaw, Thobon Sapclaw, Wormwings) and 2026_11_23_32 (Dala Fairmaw) first.
--   Quests added (14): 92111 Of Friend and Fur, 93831 Sweetpaw Jam, 91697 Meet the Elders (the start of the chain after 91696
--   Open Season), 93825, 93826, 93830, 93832, 93833, 93834, 93952, 95107, 95273, 96666, and the Horde 96830 Farsight Guided.
--   Still missing: 95108 Mystic Mix (needs the Deadwood Cauldron objects and a script), 93828 Herbs of the Hollow (only one
--   herb spot is known, the quest needs ten), 93925 Beads for Brerufa (no quest text in any source we may use).
--   New NPCs: Osi Mistpaw 256646, Suma Mossmane 260661, Elder Pinespeaker 256650, Fennar Mossmane 256626 (Barkskin Burrow);
--   Deadwood Fel-Tender 252096, Chieftain Deeproar 259875, Deadwood Death Mystic 259876, Eternal Sentry 249237.
--   Spawns where Wowhead's WoW Forever map shows them: Deadwood Den (we had one Den Guardian and one Totemic; spots seen with
--   more than one Deadwood type get one of them), Hyjal Owls, Burrow Beetles, Moonveil Moss and Bear Berries (the berry quest
--   needs 30 and we had 8 bushes). Deadwood Den is a cave: Deadwood spawns go on the cave floor where the cave is below.
--   Deadwood Den Guardian 252063 and Totemic 252116: faction 7 to 16 (Wowhead: hostile), money, drops, pickpocketing; their
--   Deadwood Tribal Beads 263439 were quest-only with no quest needing them, so they never dropped (Dala Fairmaw's currency).
--   Drops are Wowhead's player loot counts (www.wowhead.com/forever, read 23 Nov 2026): items seen at least twice, chance =
--   count over kills; money is Wowhead's average +-50%. Intact Owl Body (93833) at 40% while on the quest (Wowhead's 165/3024
--   counts every owl kill); Broken Staff (95107) always while on the quest.
--   Thark Gorax 266802 (Horde giver of 96830): faction 14 to 29 (Wowhead: Orgrimmar).
--   Quest records and lines: Data from Efficient Games (https://efficient.games), licensed under CC BY 4.0
--   (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/). Source: github.com/JIVESCORP/eg-link-output-wowf quests.enUS.
--   Changed: picked and converted to our tables. Givers, turn-ins and progress/reward lines: Wowhead Forever quest pages.
--   Chain order from the quest texts and EG Link's next-quest field: 91696 -> 92111 -> 93831 -> 91697.
